  "scope": "The production Retribution, Shockadin, Protection, Holy Protection and Ret Protection Paladin and Balance, Feral (cat) and Feral (bear) Druid reference requests against 2, 3, 4 and 5 copies of the boss, with the boss copied in each request as the application's Advanced targets setting does, plus variants that use the area abilities and rotation target choices: Holy Wrath and Consecration lines against Undead and Demon copies for the Retribution and Shockadin, a Hurricane line, Hurricane with multidot lines and multidot lines for Moonfire and Insect Swarm for the Balance Druid, multidot lines for Rake and Rip for the Feral cat, the bear without its tank assignment plain, with a Swipe line and with a Lacerate multidot line, and a multidot line for Consecration. Each is exported with the pinned Go engine and run by Go and Rust.",
  "generator": "Each request is the production reference request of its build (fixtures/mage/prepared-v2/production-BUILD.request.json) with the boss copied N times and, for the variants, castSpell lines on numberTargets >= 2 for Holy Wrath (10318 rank 2), Consecration (20924 rank 5), Hurricane (17402 rank 3) or Swipe (9908), multidot lines on numberTargets >= 2 for Moonfire (9835 rank 10), Insect Swarm (24977 rank 5), Rake (9904), Rip (9896), Lacerate (1235827) or Consecration, an Undead or Demon mob type, or no tank assignment, for N from 2 to 5; the requests are kept in the record's folder",
  "rerun": "python3 tools/prepared_v2.py compare --output <scratch> validation/2026-10-06-multi-target-paladin-druid-references/*.json",
  "criteria": {
    "comparison": "full RaidSimResult except elapsedNs, lists keyed by ID",
    "integer_counts": "exact",
    "floats": "relative 1e-9",
    "deviations": "as variances at the scale of mean^2",
    "first_fight_debug_log": "line identical"
  },
